{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18659","headline":"夏夜苦热登西楼 · 柳宗元","name":"夏夜苦热登西楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苦热中夜起，登楼独褰衣。\n山泽凝暑气，星汉湛光辉。\n火晶燥露滋，野静停风威。\n探汤汲阴井，炀竈开重扉。\n凭阑久彷徨，流汗不可挥。\n莫辩亭毒意，仰诉璿与玑。\n谅非姑射子，静胜安能希。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18659.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18659","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}